      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Virtual Pet</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"game-card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Pet</h1>\n    <div class=\"pet-container\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"pet\" id=\"pet\">\n        <div class=\"eye left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"eye right\"></div>\n        <div class=\"mouth\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"mood-text\" id=\"moodText\">Feeling happy!</p>\n    <div class=\"stats\">\n      <div class=\"stat\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Hunger</span>\n        <div class=\"bar-bg\"><div class=\"bar-fill hunger\" id=\"hungerBar\"></div></div>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"hungerValue\">100</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Happiness</span>\n        <div class=\"bar-bg\"><div class=\"bar-fill happiness\" id=\"happinessBar\"></div></div>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"happinessValue\">100</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Energy</span>\n        <div class=\"bar-bg\"><div class=\"bar-fill energy\" id=\"energyBar\"></div></div>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"energyValue\">100</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"feedBtn\" aria-label=\"Feed the pet\">Feed</button>\n      <button id=\"playBtn\" aria-label=\"Play with the pet\">Play</button>\n      <button id=\"sleepBtn\" aria-label=\"Put the pet to sleep\">Sleep</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure with pet, stats, and controls"
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": "[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b2e 0%, #2d2a4a 100%);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n}\n\n.game-card {\n  background: #2d2a4a;\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 20px;\n  border: 2px solid #4a4568;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #ffd166;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n.pet-container {\n  width: 120px;\n  height: 120px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: #3a3659;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: 3px solid #4a4568;\n  box-shadow: inset 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n.pet {\n  width: 80px;\n  height: 80px;\n  position: relative;\n  background: #ffd166;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #e6b800, 0 0 0 8px #cc9900;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n  transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.pet .eye {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 12px;\n  height: 12px;\n  background: #1e1b2e;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  top: 24px;\n}\n\n.pet .eye.left { left: 16px; }\n.pet .eye.right { right: 16px; }\n\n.pet .mouth {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 8px;\n  background: #1e1b2e;\n  border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;\n  bottom: 16px;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n}\n\n.mood-text {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #ffd166;\n  text-align: center;\n  min-height: 1.5em;\n}\n\n.stats {\n  width: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.stat {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.stat-label {\n  width: 80px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #b8b3d1;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.bar-bg {\n  flex: 1;\n  height: 16px;\n  background: #1e1b2e;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 1px solid #4a4568;\n}\n\n.bar-fill {\n  height: 100%;\n  width: 100%;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  transition: width 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.bar-fill.hunger { background: #ef476f; }\n.bar-fill.happiness { background: #ffd166; }\n.bar-fill.energy { background: #06d6a0; }\n\n.stat-value {\n  width: 36px;\n  text-align: right;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #b8b3d1;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  width: 100%;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: #ffd166;\n  color: #1e1b2e;\n  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n  flex: 1;\n  min-width: 80px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #cc9900;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ffe08a;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #cc9900, 0 0 12px rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.4);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #06d6a0;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #cc9900;\n}\n\nbutton:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  transform: none;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #999;\n  background: #999;\n}\n\nbutton:disabled:hover {\n  background: #999;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #999;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .game-card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .stat-label {\n    width: 70px;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Styles for the pixel pet and layout"
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const state = {\n  hunger: 100,\n  happiness: 100,\n  energy: 100\n};\n\nconst moodText = document.getElementById('moodText');\nconst hungerBar = document.getElementById('hungerBar');\nconst happinessBar = document.getElementById('happinessBar');\nconst energyBar = document.getElementById('energyBar');\nconst hungerValue = document.getElementById('hungerValue');\nconst happinessValue = document.getElementById('happinessValue');\nconst energyValue = document.getElementById('energyValue');\nconst feedBtn = document.getElementById('feedBtn');\nconst playBtn = document.getElementById('playBtn');\nconst sleepBtn = document.getElementById('sleepBtn');\nconst pet = document.getElementById('pet');\n\nfunction clamp(value, min, max) {\n  return Math.min(Math.max(value, min), max);\n}\n\nfunction updateUI() {\n  hungerBar.style.width = state.hunger + '%';\n  happinessBar.style.width = state.happiness + '%';\n  energyBar.style.width = state.energy + '%';\n  hungerValue.textContent = state.hunger;\n  happinessValue.textContent = state.happiness;\n  energyValue.textContent = state.energy;\n\n  if (state.hunger < 30) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'I\\'m starving! Feed me!';\n  } else if (state.energy < 30) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'So sleepy... need rest.';\n  } else if (state.happiness < 30) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'I\\'m sad... play with me?';\n  } else if (state.hunger > 80 && state.happiness > 80 && state.energy > 80) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'I feel amazing! \\u2764\\uFE0F';\n  } else {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Feeling okay.';\n  }\n\n  playBtn.disabled = state.energy < 20;\n  feedBtn.disabled = state.hunger >= 100;\n  sleepBtn.disabled = state.energy >= 100;\n\n  pet.style.transform = state.happiness < 30 ? 'rotate(5deg)' : 'rotate(0deg)';\n}\n\nfunction feed() {\n  state.hunger = clamp(state.hunger + 20, 0, 100);\n  state.energy = clamp(state.energy - 5, 0, 100);\n  updateUI();\n}\n\nfunction play() {\n  if (state.energy < 20) return;\n  state.happiness = clamp(state.happiness + 20, 0, 100);\n  state.energy = clamp(state.energy - 15, 0, 100);\n  state.hunger = clamp(state.hunger - 10, 0, 100);\n  updateUI();\n}\n\nfunction sleep() {\n  state.energy = clamp(state.energy + 30, 0, 100);\n  state.hunger = clamp(state.hunger - 10, 0, 100);\n  updateUI();\n}\n\nfeedBtn.addEventListener('click', feed);\nplayBtn.addEventListener('click', play);\nsleepBtn.addEventListener('click', sleep);\n\nupdateUI();",
      "description": "Game logic and event listeners"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Virtual Pet\n\nA simple offline browser app featuring a CSS-drawn pixel creature with hunger, happiness, and energy bars. Use the Feed, Play, and Sleep buttons to interact with your pet and watch its mood change.\n\n## Features\n\n- CSS-drawn pixel pet with expressive face\n- Three stat bars: Hunger, Happiness, Energy\n- Mood text updates based on pet's state\n- Buttons with hover, focus, and pressed states\n- Keyboard accessible controls\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide\n- No external assets, packages, or network requests\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Click **Feed** to increase hunger (and slightly decrease energy).\n3. Click **Play** to increase happiness (costs energy and hunger).\n4. Click **Sleep** to restore energy (costs some hunger).\n5. Watch the mood text and bars respond to your actions.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `styles.css` – styling\n- `script.js` – game logic\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All buttons have `aria-label` attributes.\n- Focus states are clearly visible.\n- Buttons are disabled when actions are not possible (e.g., Play when energy is too low).\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": "Project documentation"
    }
  ]
}